  "term": "droperidol",
  "definition": "Droperidol is a butyrophenone drug with effects broadly similar to haloperidol. In mental health and medical settings, it has been used to reduce agitation in acute psychoses and also to help produce a calm, cooperative state, as well as to prevent nausea and vomiting.",
